To scale up your infrastructure by adding more subnets or tiers, you can follow a modular approach. This involves defining reusable modules and using loops or lists to dynamically create additional subnets and tiers. Here's how you can extend your existing Terraform configuration to accommodate more subnets and tiers:

### Step-by-Step Guide

