### Step-by-Step Guide to Creating Backup Buckets with Terraform

#### 1. **Install Terraform**
First, ensure you have Terraform installed on your system. You can download it from the official Terraform website: https://www.terraform.io/downloads.html

#### 2. **Initialize Your Terraform Project**
Create a new directory for your Terraform project and navigate into it:

```sh
